{
  "id": "paste-history",
  "name": "Paste History",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "author": "yiminlin",
  "folyn": ">=0.1.0",
  "tier": "sandbox",
  "main": "index.js",
  "html": "index.html",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "description": "剪贴板历史：自动记录复制内容，左栏查看文本/图片详情，右栏按时间倒序浏览，双击一键复制回剪贴板",
